    "PhysarumFlow[maze, {p1, p2, ...}] runs the Tero current-reinforcement \
flow model through the free cells of a maze Image, with food at the \
unit-square points p *i*. PhysarumFlow[{p1, p2, ...}] grows an adaptive flow \
network between food sources on a 2D lattice. PhysarumFlow[g, {v1, v2, ...}] \
runs the flow model on the Graph g with food at vertices v *i*. \
PhysarumFlow[spec, opts] runs the flow model with the given options.", 
